Text: 4. Methods Before experimenting with OGTD, an unique aspect of Greek which is the accentuation of characters for correct pronunciation needed to be normalized. When posting a tweet, many users omit accents due to their haste, result- ing in a mixed dataset containing fully accented tweets, partially-accented tweets, and non-accented tweets. achieve data uniformity and to avoid ambiguity, every word is lower-cased and then normalized to its non-accented equivalent.

